-Oh, by the way, oh, by the way,

00:00:03.236 --> 00:00:04.270
everything's politically correct
today.

00:00:04.270 --> 00:00:06.239 align:start size:94% position:6%
You're not supposed to say
"Sasquatch."

00:00:06.239 --> 00:00:07.007 align:start size:94% position:6%
-No. Why?
-Yeah, no.

00:00:07.007 --> 00:00:09.509
There's a --
The PC thing now is "wood ape."

00:00:09.509 --> 00:00:11.911 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Why?
Who does "Sasquatch" offend?

00:00:11.911 --> 00:00:14.147 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I have no idea,
but you can't say it.

00:00:14.147 --> 00:00:15.015 line:92%
-You have to say "wood ape"?

00:00:15.015 --> 00:00:17.617 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You can't say "Bigfoot."
-No, you can.

00:00:17.617 --> 00:00:18.451 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I'm not kidding.
-Really?

00:00:18.451 --> 00:00:19.586 align:start size:94% position:6%
-This is not a bit.
This is absolutely true.

00:00:19.586 --> 00:00:21.955 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Is this because people
with big feet are offended?

00:00:21.955 --> 00:00:23.423 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Maybe it's that.
-Yeah.

00:00:23.423 --> 00:00:25.892 line:92%
-But I think the notion is that

00:00:25.892 --> 00:00:29.295 align:start size:94% position:6%
the terms "Sasquatch"
and "Bigfoot" are pejorative

00:00:29.295 --> 00:00:31.131 line:92%
'cause they sound "looney."

00:00:31.131 --> 00:00:34.567 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Oh. Oh.
-But "wood ape" is fine.

00:00:34.567 --> 00:00:35.101 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Yeah, wood ape.

00:00:35.101 --> 00:00:37.637 align:start size:94% position:6%
If you go out looking for
wood ape, you're a scientist.

00:00:37.637 --> 00:00:39.105 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah.
-Yeah.

00:00:39.105 --> 00:00:41.107 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:00:41.107 --> 00:00:42.509 align:start size:94% position:6%
This is what
I'm really excited about

00:00:42.509 --> 00:00:44.644 align:start size:94% position:6%
watching this show is you
have -- You're on Instagram.

00:00:44.644 --> 00:00:46.679 align:start size:94% position:6%
And you've got a lot of likes.
You're at 14,000 likes.

00:00:46.679 --> 00:00:50.450
You're obviously a popular guy
on Instagram, but your son --

00:00:50.450 --> 00:00:53.186 align:start size:94% position:6%
John seems to be the one
that's busting you.

00:00:53.186 --> 00:00:54.054 size:88% position:44% line:92%
-He gives me a lot of --

00:00:54.054 --> 00:00:55.422 align:start size:94% position:6%
my kids think I'm lame
on social media.

00:00:55.422 --> 00:00:56.456 size:84% position:42% line:92%
-Yeah, so here you are.

00:00:56.456 --> 00:00:58.058 align:start size:94% position:6%
You're like,
"Thanks to my friends --

00:00:58.058 --> 00:01:01.227
Thanks to my #friends at Tommy's
for a great #lunch."

00:01:01.227 --> 00:01:03.897 align:start size:94% position:6%
Then, your son just wrote,
"#lunch."

00:01:03.897 --> 00:01:06.566 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Light laughter ]

00:01:06.566 --> 00:01:07.600 line:92%
-My sons are trolling me.

00:01:07.600 --> 00:01:08.935 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Yeah, it's really great.
They're trolling you.

00:01:08.935 --> 00:01:12.138 align:start size:94% position:6%
"The Grinder finally came home
and ran into Joel Zadak.

00:01:12.138 --> 00:01:14.140 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
#Teenlife."

00:01:14.140 --> 00:01:15.508 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
"#Teenlife??!"

00:01:15.508 --> 00:01:16.342 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
[ Laughter ]

00:01:16.342 --> 00:01:20.113 align:start size:94% position:6%
That seems like --
That seems like a fair burn

00:01:20.113 --> 00:01:21.314 align:start size:94% position:6%
