-Yeah, I mean...

00:01:21.314 --> 00:01:24.918
I still -- I'm like,
"Look, guys, it could be worse.

00:01:24.918 --> 00:01:25.852 align:start size:94% position:6%
I'm trying, you know."
-Yeah.

00:01:25.852 --> 00:01:27.954
-I'm not this Millennial.
-You're a dad who's trying.

00:01:27.954 --> 00:01:30.690
-I'm a dad.
-You're a dad and, look again --

00:01:30.690 --> 00:01:32.725 align:start size:94% position:6%
