in your life.

00:01:32.725 --> 00:01:34.360 align:start size:94% position:6%
But there's one thing
I wanted to talk to you about

00:01:34.360 --> 00:01:35.462 line:92%
because I know that you have --

00:01:35.462 --> 00:01:37.497 align:start size:94% position:6%
you visited the White House
a lot.

00:01:37.497 --> 00:01:40.600
-I've been to every White House
since "The West Wing" premiered.

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:41.301 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
-Which is exciting.

00:01:41.301 --> 00:01:45.405 align:start size:94% position:6%
-So every administration
from Clinton to Bush to Obama.

00:01:45.405 --> 00:01:47.774 align:start size:94% position:6%
-And a very different vibe
each time?

00:01:47.774 --> 00:01:48.675 line:92%
-That's what's fascinating.

00:01:48.675 --> 00:01:53.146
The Clinton White House was
the most welcoming, most casual.

00:01:53.146 --> 00:01:54.848 align:start size:94% position:6%
He had, like,
his Big Bertha Golf Driver

00:01:54.848 --> 00:01:57.484 align:start size:94% position:6%
leaning up against the wall
of the Oval Office.

00:01:57.484 --> 00:01:59.486
-Uh-huh.
-And he'd be like, "Come on in.

00:01:59.486 --> 00:02:00.653 align:start size:94% position:6%
Sit at the desk.
Take a picture."

00:02:00.653 --> 00:02:02.856
And he was great. He was great.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:02.856 --> 00:02:06.025 align:start size:94% position:6%
And the Bush White House
was really formal,

00:02:06.025 --> 00:02:07.760 align:start size:94% position:6%
and you couldn't even go
in the Oval.

00:02:07.760 --> 00:02:09.762 align:start size:94% position:6%
It had, like, literally,
a velvet rope,

00:02:09.762 --> 00:02:11.131 align:start size:94% position:6%
and it was like a sanctum.
-Mm-hmm.

00:02:11.131 --> 00:02:14.834 align:start size:94% position:6%
-You could peer in,
but you were not going in.

00:02:14.834 --> 00:02:17.470 line:92%
And Obama was like -- felt like

00:02:17.470 --> 00:02:20.440 align:start size:94% position:6%
he was just
so much hustle and bustle.

00:02:20.440 --> 00:02:21.574 line:92%
And I think every president

00:02:21.574 --> 00:02:22.775 align:start size:94% position:6%
brings their own kind of thing
to it.

00:02:22.775 --> 00:02:24.410
-Now, you haven't been
to the Trump White House,

00:02:24.410 --> 00:02:25.478 align:start size:94% position:6%
but you do have
a little bit of history.

00:02:25.478 --> 00:02:28.615 align:start size:94% position:6%
Is it true that Donald Trump
once donated $50,000

00:02:28.615 --> 00:02:29.282 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
to a charity event?

00:02:29.282 --> 00:02:32.819 align:start size:94% position:6%
-I did. I was doing an event
for Habitat for Humanity.

00:02:32.819 --> 00:02:35.155 align:start size:94% position:6%
-Uh-huh.
-And I was on a talk show.

00:02:35.155 --> 00:02:37.190 line:92%
He called in, and he donated,

00:02:37.190 --> 00:02:39.425 align:start size:94% position:6%
I think, $5,000
to Habitat for Humanity.

00:02:39.425 --> 00:02:40.760 align:start size:94% position:6%
-That's great.
-It was nice.

00:02:40.760 --> 00:02:41.561 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Applause ]
Yeah.

00:02:41.561 --> 00:02:44.931
-Did you, um --
Did anybody ever see the check,

00:02:44.931 --> 00:02:46.099 align:start size:94% position:6%
or was it
like one of those things --

00:02:46.099 --> 00:02:49.035 align:start size:94% position:6%
[ Laughter ]
-Yes, they saw the check.

00:02:49.035 --> 00:02:50.570 line:92%
And you know what's amazing?

00:02:50.570 --> 00:02:51.604 line:92%
You know who it was signed by?

00:02:51.604 --> 00:02:52.472 align:start size:94% position:6%
Vladimir Putin.
-No!

00:02:52.472 --> 00:02:54.741 align:start size:94% position:6%
-It was unbelievable.
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:02:54.741 --> 00:02:55.542 align:start size:94% position:6% line:92%
It was un--

00:02:55.542 --> 00:02:56.676 align:start size:94% position:6%
-As long
as the houses got built.

00:02:56.676 --> 00:02:58.811
[ Chuckling ]
As long as the houses got built.

00:02:58.811 --> 00:03:00.947 align:start size:94% position:6%
Thanks so much for being here.
Congrats on the show.

00:03:00.947 --> 00:03:02.315 align:start size:94% position:6%
And it's always
just such a delight.

00:03:02.315 --> 00:03:04.918 size:84% position:42%
